# CLI uploads (vercel deploy): this file REPLACES .gitignore-based exclusion,
# so it must mirror .gitignore. Critically: .env must not ride an upload — the
# remote build must resolve the engine from the pinned github: tag, never a
# local ENGINE_PATH. raw/ holds every upload of every intake channel, and on the
# two multi-game channels (yumegiwa, " GBVSR Replay") most of it is another game.
.env*
node_modules
raw
cache
secrets
.nuxt
.output
.vercel
.data
dist
public/data
